#: webapp/templates/survey-missions/detail-component.html
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to discover records for this survey mission? "
"Discovery may take a long time to finish."
msgstr ""
"Tem a certeza de que pretende descobrir registos para esta missão? A "
"descoberta pode demorar bastante tempo a terminar."

#: webapp/templates/survey-missions/detail-component.html
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to cancel this survey mission's discovery? The "
"survey-related records it created until now are kept."
msgstr ""
"Tem a certeza de que pretende cancelar a descoberta desta missão? Os "
"registos que criou até agora são mantidos."

#: webapp/templates/survey-missions/detail-actions.html
